{"vid":"lVX-9QW58Gc","source":"lVX-9QW58Gc.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.7,"txt":"Hi everybody. I'm Jay Leno and this is"},{"t":2.3,"txt":"my garage. This is a car that we've been"},{"t":4.6,"txt":"working on for about the last year. It's"},{"t":6.2,"txt":"called the Echo Jet. Uh it's uh debuted"},{"t":9.5,"txt":"at SEMA about uh two years ago. It used"},{"t":12.5,"txt":"an LT 101 jet engine. It runs on"},{"t":14.6,"txt":"biodiesel. And I this car for probably a"},{"t":17.8,"txt":"little over a million bucks. If you"},{"t":19.8,"txt":"wonder where all that money went,"},{"t":20.9,"txt":"welders. Welders. They're bleeding me"},{"t":22.8,"txt":"dry because they're skilled technicians."},{"t":25,"txt":"They can do the work that uh most people"},{"t":27.8,"txt":"cannot do. Uh, you know, it's"},{"t":30,"txt":"interesting. Uh, this country was built"},{"t":32.2,"txt":"by welders and somewhere along the line,"},{"t":33.9,"txt":"we kind of lost our focus. I I guess"},{"t":36.3,"txt":"it's cool to sit in a little cubicle and"},{"t":38.1,"txt":"make 80 grand a year pushing a computer."},{"t":40.1,"txt":"Or you can actually do something that"},{"t":41.4,"txt":"actually helps the country, fix our"},{"t":43.1,"txt":"infrastructure, build bridges. You know,"},{"t":45.8,"txt":"the whole country has fallen apart"},{"t":47.4,"txt":"because we've lost some of the basics of"},{"t":50.5,"txt":"what made this country great. You know,"},{"t":52.2,"txt":"when you see welders now, they have this"},{"t":53.8,"txt":"color hair. They probably have the black"},{"t":55.5,"txt":"thing in the front, but it's mostly all"},{"t":57,"txt":"gray. And what we need are young people"},{"t":59.2,"txt":"that want to do this job. And you can"},{"t":61,"txt":"make a lot of money doing this job. I"},{"t":62.6,"txt":"know how much welders charge me. I mean,"},{"t":64.9,"txt":"look at the welding that we've done on"},{"t":66.6,"txt":"this uh chassis here for the Echo Jet."},{"t":69.4,"txt":"Beautiful job. This is a skill. It's a"},{"t":72.2,"txt":"skill as much as anything else in this"},{"t":74.2,"txt":"country. But for some reason, I don't"},{"t":76.2,"txt":"know where working with our hands"},{"t":77.8,"txt":"suddenly became a detriment. You know,"},{"t":80,"txt":"we didn't win World War II only because"},{"t":82.1,"txt":"we had the best soldiers. We won also"},{"t":83.9,"txt":"because we could turn out a plane, a"},{"t":86.2,"txt":"Liberator, a B7 every 55 minutes. We"},{"t":89.5,"txt":"could actually make airplanes quicker"},{"t":91.3,"txt":"than they could shoot them down. And"},{"t":92.9,"txt":"that's one of the reasons because we had"},{"t":94.3,"txt":"skilled people, young people, 18, 19, 20"},{"t":97.2,"txt":"years old that were making airplanes."},{"t":99.1,"txt":"Now, those same guys are still making"},{"t":100.6,"txt":"airplanes except they're 80, 90 years"},{"t":102.6,"txt":"old. But the we need to have them pass"},{"t":105.2,"txt":"it on down to you guys. You know, this"},{"t":107.4,"txt":"is a skill. It's a skill that will"},{"t":109.2,"txt":"become even more and more needed as uh"},{"t":112.2,"txt":"as as we go along. So I I tell people,"},{"t":115.4,"txt":"you know, check out the American Welding"},{"t":117.3,"txt":"Society, go to their website. You can"},{"t":119.4,"txt":"make a good living and you can become a"},{"t":121.8,"txt":"rich person and you can bleed people"},{"t":124,"txt":"like me dry because I need you."},{"t":130,"txt":"Well, I mean, if I had to, you know, go"},{"t":131.7,"txt":"back and think to when I was a kid, you"},{"t":133.4,"txt":"know, I felt like that hopelessness of,"},{"t":135.8,"txt":"you know, deadend jobs. Welding has"},{"t":137.9,"txt":"allowed me to to be able to feel like I"},{"t":140.5,"txt":"have a career. I started my own shop"},{"t":142.6,"txt":"three years ago, Fuller Hot Rods in"},{"t":144.9,"txt":"Atlanta. We build custom cars, custom"},{"t":146.9,"txt":"bikes. We mainly specialize in metal."},{"t":149,"txt":"Basically, we just build whatever we"},{"t":150.3,"txt":"want as long as the customer's happy and"},{"t":151.8,"txt":"we build something that he's pleased"},{"t":153.1,"txt":"with. Uh we pretty much kind of have"},{"t":156.1,"txt":"free reign to do what makes us happy."},{"t":158.7,"txt":"Overhauling came in and overhauling. We"},{"t":161.1,"txt":"did a 56 Bair. That's where I met Troy"},{"t":164.1,"txt":"and Brian Fuller and Jeff Booths and all"},{"t":167,"txt":"those just phenomenal phenomenal metal"},{"t":169.8,"txt":"fabricators. And everybody was so happy"},{"t":173.4,"txt":"I guess with what I did, they asked me"},{"t":174.8,"txt":"to come back and do another overall on."},{"t":176.7,"txt":"So by the time that I was done with the"},{"t":178.9,"txt":"SEMA car, I had experience working on"},{"t":180.9,"txt":"show cars, working under deadlines,"},{"t":182.6,"txt":"working on television, and with all of"},{"t":185,"txt":"that, I got the job with Extreme 4x4."},{"t":188.2,"txt":"So, for the past three and a half years,"},{"t":189.8,"txt":"I've been building off-road trucks on a"},{"t":192,"txt":"how-to show for millions of people,"},{"t":194.5,"txt":"teaching them how to how to build cool"},{"t":196.6,"txt":"machines. When I when I won Hot Rod of"},{"t":199.2,"txt":"the Year, it was exciting because, you"},{"t":200.9,"txt":"know, I I grew up running to the news"},{"t":202.3,"txt":"stand looking at Hot Rod magazine. And"},{"t":204.9,"txt":"to be recognized as a young guy and to"},{"t":207.8,"txt":"get Hot Rod of the Year, I mean, it was"},{"t":209.2,"txt":"it was awesome. I mean, you're on top of"},{"t":210.9,"txt":"the world. I get a lot of people come by"},{"t":212.5,"txt":"the shop now because of our the few"},{"t":214.4,"txt":"shows we've done and being in Hot Ro"},{"t":216,"txt":"magazine, everything. And I get a lot of"},{"t":217.2,"txt":"young guys. You know, we go out and"},{"t":218.3,"txt":"speak at the college once a year at Wild"},{"t":220.4,"txt":"Tech uh to the graduating class. We do a"},{"t":222.5,"txt":"lot of job shadowing at the shop from"},{"t":224.2,"txt":"the local high schools and uh you know,"},{"t":226.2,"txt":"we throw a welding helmet on these kids."},{"t":227.8,"txt":"Some of them never been around it and"},{"t":228.9,"txt":"some of them have had it at shop class."},{"t":230.9,"txt":"So, we'll throw a welding helmet on"},{"t":232.2,"txt":"them. They'll hang around during the day"},{"t":233.3,"txt":"and kind of see how cool it is. We got"},{"t":235,"txt":"the cars we're doing in bare metal. We"},{"t":236.4,"txt":"got the finished cars so they can see"},{"t":237.8,"txt":"what it takes to to do something and"},{"t":239.7,"txt":"welding it all together. There's so much"},{"t":241.4,"txt":"opportunity. You know, I got into"},{"t":243.3,"txt":"welding, you know, kind of like a lot of"},{"t":244.7,"txt":"people did out of necessity. If you want"},{"t":246.6,"txt":"to build something bad enough, you have"},{"t":248.9,"txt":"to learn to weld. I mean, that's just"},{"t":250.6,"txt":"part of the gig. And eventually, I ended"},{"t":252.8,"txt":"up in a tech school where I was actually"},{"t":254.9,"txt":"taught and trained on, you know, how to"},{"t":256.9,"txt":"MIG, how to TIG, how to gas. It's been a"},{"t":259.5,"txt":"great experience. And and it's just, you"},{"t":261.2,"txt":"know, really allowed me to be able to"},{"t":262.8,"txt":"build what I want to build. You even my"},{"t":265.3,"txt":"classmates from Wii, they not all of"},{"t":267.5,"txt":"them have gone down the automotive"},{"t":269.3,"txt":"field. A lot of them are working with um"},{"t":271.8,"txt":"structural like building buildings and"},{"t":273.5,"txt":"skyscrapers like with all these new"},{"t":275,"txt":"condos booming up. There's a couple guys"},{"t":276.6,"txt":"that are doing art. A few guys have gone"},{"t":279.4,"txt":"up to work on the pipeline and those"},{"t":281.8,"txt":"guys make a killing. They make good"},{"t":284.6,"txt":"money. They have time to play and"},{"t":286.8,"txt":"they're happy."},{"t":287.9,"txt":"There's there's very good money to be"},{"t":289.5,"txt":"made in the industry. You know, whether"},{"t":291,"txt":"you're welding cars together, bikes, uh"},{"t":293.2,"txt":"highrises, whatever, you know, it's the"},{"t":294.7,"txt":"same thing."},{"t":295,"txt":"I enjoy the freedom and the creativity"},{"t":296.6,"txt":"to be able to build whatever you want."},{"t":298.4,"txt":"And that's what welding allows you to do"},{"t":299.9,"txt":"is you make something and you can put it"},{"t":302.2,"txt":"together."},{"t":302.9,"txt":"When I talk to employers, they they"},{"t":304.7,"txt":"constantly tell me they say, \"Some of"},{"t":306.2,"txt":"the best welders I have ever had are"},{"t":308.2,"txt":"women. They just have that patience."},{"t":310.1,"txt":"They have that rhythm. They have the"},{"t":312.3,"txt":"attention to detail. There should be no"},{"t":314.1,"txt":"fear for women getting in the welding"},{"t":315.4,"txt":"industry at all."},{"t":316.6,"txt":"My grandfather was a pipe fitter and we,"},{"t":318.5,"txt":"you know, he was the old guy that"},{"t":319.8,"txt":"everybody go have Johnny welding. I"},{"t":321.4,"txt":"spent uh a lot of lot of time brazing"},{"t":323.4,"txt":"pop cans together and there, you know,"},{"t":325.4,"txt":"taking a wire wire brush with a piece of"},{"t":327.5,"txt":"pipe look. Okay, I came off the Titanic,"},{"t":329.1,"txt":"you know, clean that up. We're going to"},{"t":330.1,"txt":"make a basketball pole. You know, you'd"},{"t":331.3,"txt":"scrub on it for days and things chrome"},{"t":333.1,"txt":"and it was I'm like, \"Is that good"},{"t":334.4,"txt":"enough?\" No, not good enough. Never good"},{"t":335.9,"txt":"enough. So, and that's what I tell my"},{"t":337.4,"txt":"guys at the shop. If you're cleaning the"},{"t":338.9,"txt":"shop up or you're buffing that $2"},{"t":341,"txt":"million riblet car, it's the same job to"},{"t":342.9,"txt":"me. You know, everything's got to be"},{"t":344.2,"txt":"done the right way. And uh I think he"},{"t":346.1,"txt":"instilled that in me and has kept kept"},{"t":348.3,"txt":"that focus. And then you can instill it"},{"t":350.2,"txt":"in these young kids, man. It's it's an"},{"t":352.3,"txt":"instant home run."},{"t":353.1,"txt":"Get connected to the job you want"},{"t":354.7,"txt":"through the American Welding Society."},{"t":356.6,"txt":"With a career in welding, you'll have"},{"t":358.2,"txt":"great opportunities right at home or"},{"t":360.5,"txt":"anywhere around the world. Decide where"},{"t":362.6,"txt":"you want to be, and welding will get you"},{"t":364.5,"txt":"there. Transportation, manufacturing,"},{"t":367.1,"txt":"power creation, and delivery, the list"},{"t":369.4,"txt":"goes on. Every aspect of our daily lives"},{"t":372.2,"txt":"is affected and made better by welding."},{"t":374.7,"txt":"So, skilled welders are always in high"},{"t":377,"txt":"demand. Welding careers offer excellent"},{"t":379.4,"txt":"opportunities to make great money in the"},{"t":381.1,"txt":"exciting field of your choice. So, if"},{"t":383.3,"txt":"you want a career that combines hands-on"},{"t":385,"txt":"skill with creativity, take the first"},{"t":387.4,"txt":"step by visiting aws.org."}],"words":[{"t":0.719,"w":"Hi"},{"t":0.96,"w":"everybody."},{"t":1.28,"w":"I'm"},{"t":1.52,"w":"Jay"},{"t":1.76,"w":"Leno"},{"t":2,"w":"and"},{"t":2.159,"w":"this"},{"t":2.24,"w":"is"},{"t":2.32,"w":"my"},{"t":2.48,"w":"garage."},{"t":2.96,"w":"This"},{"t":3.12,"w":"is"},{"t":3.2,"w":"a"},{"t":3.439,"w":"car"},{"t":3.919,"w":"that"},{"t":4.16,"w":"we've"},{"t":4.4,"w":"been"},{"t":4.56,"w":"working"},{"t":4.799,"w":"on"},{"t":4.96,"w":"for"},{"t":5.2,"w":"about"},{"t":5.359,"w":"the"},{"t":5.52,"w":"last"},{"t":5.759,"w":"year."},{"t":6,"w":"It's"},{"t":6.16,"w":"called"},{"t":6.24,"w":"the"},{"t":6.48,"w":"Echo"},{"t":6.879,"w":"Jet."},{"t":7.6,"w":"Uh"},{"t":8.24,"w":"it's"},{"t":8.8